{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"22119bcebbf291618307759c2e882a027ddc83c5ffa69a805a937dc20ae4ec6b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":19,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「你要為以色列的首領唱哀歌，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["說，",{"text":"「『你的母親像什麼？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她就像獅群中的母獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臥在雄壯的獅子中養育幼獅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"母獅養大一頭幼獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使牠成為一頭猛獅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠學會了捕獵和吃人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的人知道後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便設陷阱捉住牠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用鉤子拉到埃及。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"母獅盼著牠回來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼見指望落空，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便又養育一頭幼獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使牠成為一頭猛獅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠出入獅群，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長成一頭猛獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"學會了捕食和吃人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠夷平列國的堡壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們的城邑淪為廢墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遍地都因牠的咆哮而震驚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"於是，列國便從四面圍攻牠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"設網羅捕捉牠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠落入他們的陷阱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們用鉤子鉤住牠，把牠關進籠裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解送到巴比倫王那裡囚禁起來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"於是，在以色列的山嶺上再也聽不見牠的吼聲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「『你母親像葡萄園中的一棵葡萄樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽在溪水旁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"枝繁葉茂，碩果纍纍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為水源充沛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它的枝子粗壯，可作王的杖。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它的樹幹高大，直插雲霄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"枝葉茂密，遠遠可見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但它被憤怒地連根拔起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拋在地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"東風吹乾了它的果實，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"粗壯的枝幹折斷枯乾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被火焚燒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在，它被栽種在乾旱的曠野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"火從枝幹蔓延，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀了它的果實，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有留下一根粗壯的枝幹可作王的杖。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「這是一首哀歌，可作哀悼之用。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/19.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/20.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/18.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}